sequenceDiagram
    %%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'actorTextColor': '#000000', 'signalTextColor': '#000000', 'labelTextColor': '#000000', 'noteBkgColor': '#ffffff', 'noteTextColor': '#000000' }}}%%
    autonumber
    
    participant User
    participant Client as behaviors_client.js
    participant Panel as BotPanel
    participant View as PanelView
    participant CLI as CLISession
    participant Bot as Bot
    participant Behaviors as Behaviors
    participant Actions as Actions
    participant Action as Action
    participant Settings as ExecutionSettings
    
    User->>Client: clicks "Submit to Chat"
    activate Client
    Client->>Panel: postMessage({command: 'sendToChat'})
    activate Panel
    
    Note over Client,Panel: MESSAGE CROSSES WEBVIEW BOUNDARY
    
    Panel->>Panel: currentBehavior = botData.behaviors.current_behavior
    Note right of Panel: "exploration"
    Panel->>Panel: currentAction = botData.behaviors.current_action
    Note right of Panel: null (collapsed)
    Panel->>Panel: submitCmd = `submit ${currentBehavior}`
    Note right of Panel: "submit exploration"
    
    Panel->>View: execute(submitCmd)
    activate View
    View->>CLI: stdin.write("submit exploration\n")
    activate CLI
    
    Note over View,CLI: COMMAND CROSSES PROCESS BOUNDARY (Node.js → Python)
    
    CLI->>CLI: verb, args = _parse_command(cmd)
    Note right of CLI: verb="submit", args="exploration"
    CLI->>Bot: submit_current()
    activate Bot
    
    Bot->>Behaviors: navigate_to("exploration")
    activate Behaviors
    Behaviors-->>Bot: behavior
    deactivate Behaviors
    
    Bot->>Settings: get_execution_mode("exploration", "clarify")
    activate Settings
    Note right of Settings: Read logs/execution_settings.json
    Settings-->>Bot: "skip"
    deactivate Settings
    
    Note over Bot,Settings: clarify=skip, loop to find first non-skip
    
    Bot->>Settings: get_execution_mode("exploration", "strategy")
    activate Settings
    Settings-->>Bot: "skip"
    deactivate Settings
    
    Note over Bot,Settings: strategy=skip, continue loop
    
    Bot->>Settings: get_execution_mode("exploration", "build")
    activate Settings
    Settings-->>Bot: "combine_next"
    deactivate Settings
    
    Note over Bot,Settings: build≠skip, break loop and navigate
    
    Bot->>Actions: navigate_to("build")
    activate Actions
    Actions-->>Bot: action
    deactivate Actions
    
    Bot->>Bot: context = ActionContext()
    Bot->>Bot: context.scope = self._scope
    
    Bot->>Action: get_instructions(context, include_scope=True)
    activate Action
    Note right of Action: Load rules template
    Action-->>Bot: instructions (build)
    deactivate Action
    
    Note over Bot,Action: execution_mode=combine_next, append next actions
    
    Bot->>Settings: get_execution_mode("exploration", "validate")
    activate Settings
    Settings-->>Bot: "combine_next"
    deactivate Settings
    
    Bot->>Actions: find_by_name("validate")
    activate Actions
    Actions-->>Bot: validate_action
    deactivate Actions
    
    Bot->>Action: get_instructions(None, include_scope=False)
    activate Action
    Action-->>Bot: instructions (validate)
    deactivate Action
    
    Bot->>Bot: instructions.add_display("## Next action: validate")
    
    Bot->>Settings: get_execution_mode("exploration", "render")
    activate Settings
    Settings-->>Bot: "combine_next"
    deactivate Settings
    
    Bot->>Actions: find_by_name("render")
    activate Actions
    Actions-->>Bot: render_action
    deactivate Actions
    
    Bot->>Action: get_instructions(None, include_scope=False)
    activate Action
    Action-->>Bot: instructions (render)
    deactivate Action
    
    Bot->>Bot: instructions.add_display("## Next action: render")
    
    Note over Bot: Combined: build + validate + render<br/>Skipped: clarify, strategy
    
    Bot->>Bot: pyperclip.copy(instructions)
    Bot->>Behaviors: save_state()
    activate Behaviors
    Behaviors-->>Bot: 
    deactivate Behaviors
    
    Bot-->>CLI: {status: 'success', actions_run: [...], actions_skipped: [...]}
    deactivate Bot
    
    CLI->>CLI: json_response = json.dumps(result)
    CLI-->>View: stdout.write(json + "<<<END_OF_RESPONSE>>>")
    deactivate CLI
    
    Note over View,CLI: RESPONSE CROSSES PROCESS BOUNDARY (Python → Node.js)
    
    View->>View: parse JSON from buffer
    View-->>Panel: parsed result
    deactivate View
    
    Panel->>Panel: showInformationMessage('Instructions submitted!')
    Panel-->>Client: result
    deactivate Panel
    
    Note over Client,Panel: UI UPDATE CROSSES BACK TO WEBVIEW
    
    Client-->>User: success notification
    deactivate Client
    
    Note over User: Combined instructions in clipboard<br/>Pasted to Chat automatically
